        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMware_Fusion?link_extraction_failed=true"/>
        <updated>2026-04-28T13:39:33.558Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[VMware Fusion Player is introduced. Similar to its Workstation counterpart, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMware_Workstation_Player" title="VMware Workstation Player" id="mwA4c">VMware Workstation Player</a>, it is released for free for non-commercial use. Fusion 12 adds support for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MacOS_Big_Sur" title="MacOS Big Sur" id="mwA4g">macOS Big Sur</a>, DirectX 11 and OpenGL 4.1, an external GPU, USB 3.1, and more. Security fixes were also introduced.<sup about="#mwt279" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:0_16-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;:0&quot;}}"><a href="#cite_note-:0-16" id="mwA4k"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA4o"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA4s">[</span>16<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA4w">]</span></span></a></sup>]]></content>
    </entry>
